# OrcaRouter GUI evidence: orca-evidence/ is purely the output directory of
# tools/gui-evidence/run_gui_evidence.py. The harness ships in the patch; the
# screenshots and manifest it produces are run output, so the whole directory
# stays untracked and nothing under it can ever be mistaken for shipped work.
/orca-evidence/
